nzyme A(4-)\", \"coenzyme A\"], \"producedByEvent\": [11124735], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-162743\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-162743.6\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 113519, \"displayName\": \"H2O [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H2O\", \"water\"], \"producedByEvent\": [11124735], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-113519\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-113519.3\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 113564, \"displayName\": \"NADP+ [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NADP+\", \"NADP(+)\", \"NADP\", \"Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate\", \"beta-Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate\", \"TPN\", \"Triphosphopyridine nucleotide\"], \"producedByEvent\": [11124735, 11124735], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-113564\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-113564.4\"}, 113564], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 11124743, \"displayName\": \"Elongation of eicosapentaenoyl-CoA to docosapentaenoyl-CoA\", \"followingEvent\": [11124735], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Elongation of eicosapentaenoyl-CoA to docosapentaenoyl-CoA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Plasmodium falciparum\", \"stId\": \"R-PFA-2046100\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-PFA-2046100.1\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"PFA\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 170928, \"displayName\": \"Plasmodium falciparum\", \"name\": [\"Plasmodium falciparum\", \"malaria parasite P. falciparum\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"5833\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Plasmodium falciparum\", \"stId\": \"R-PFA-2046090\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-PFA-2046090.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\"}]}"
